The line above pins WHICH records were checked. The spot-check selector picks a
median row per category, so its output moves whenever the underlying row set
changes — as it did when a merge defect was corrected. Without pinning, a
signature could silently come to refer to records nobody ever looked at.
scripts/07_publish_gate.py compares this list against the current build and
blocks publication if they differ.

Deleting this file returns every document and figure to DRAFT on the next build.
